{"about_the_game":"Get ready for a gaming experience like no other with Market Warfare \u2013 a strategy game that blends the accessible charm of Tower Defense with the heart-pounding intensity of real-time strategy games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnter the battlefield as the brave commander of the Fruit Army, entrusted with the pivotal mission of stopping the evil Vegetables and safeguarding the market\u2019s very existence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the individual skillset of each fruit under your command. The key to victory? Assembling a squad that synergizes flawlessly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be on guard \u2013 the Vegetables are far from mere pushovers. In a refreshing departure from typical Tower Defense fare, Market Warfare presents a challenge like no other. The adversary\u2019s relentless assault seeks to dismantle your defenses with every attack. Numerous waves of enemies, armored foes, and the unexpected appearance of Special Units keep you on your toes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdaptation becomes the key; reinforce your defenses or pivot your entire strategy to outlast the storm. Get ready for a gaming adventure that pushes your tactical prowess to the edge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you prepared to lead your Fruit Army to victory? The market\u2019s fate rests in your hands!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Impenatrable defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2383880/18472e43a6ce153501c4aee1b487263afe437695.jpg"},{"name":"Like a verdulera","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2383880/e8361e007b34afa5f753043a3fe3e753f038ea94.jpg"},{"name":"Verde que te quiero verde","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2383880/152738ceb67f70ebe09319b3e52725ddef01d98f.jpg"},{"name":"I'll deal with it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2383880/c37be225dcc67167eb50b8fc6dced1fc3c7d6687.jpg"},{"name":"Do not play with fi